---
---
<div class="financial-result-container">
  <div class="result-header">
    <span class="eyebrow">Hesaplama Çıktısı</span>
    <h3 class="result-title">Finansal Sonuç</h3>
  </div>

  <div class="kpi-hero-box">
    <span class="kpi-label">Toplam Karbon Maruziyeti</span>
    <strong class="kpi-hero-value" id="kpi-exposure">€1.385.152</strong>
    <span class="kpi-sub mono">Yıllık tahmini brüt yükümlülük</span>
  </div>

  <div class="kpi-grid">
    <div class="kpi-item">
      <span class="kpi-name">Ton Başına Karbon Maliyeti</span>
      <strong class="kpi-num" id="kpi-per-ton">€138,52</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="kpi-item">
      <span class="kpi-name">Mevcut Brüt Marj</span>
      <strong class="kpi-num" id="kpi-current-margin">%28,7</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="kpi-item">
      <span class="kpi-name">Karbon Sonrası Brüt Marj</span>
      <strong class="kpi-num" id="kpi-adjusted-margin">%12,4</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="kpi-item">
      <span class="kpi-name">Marj Kaybı</span>
      <strong class="kpi-num warning-num" id="kpi-margin-delta">−16,3 puan</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="kpi-item">
      <span class="kpi-name">Marjı Koruyan Min. Satış Fiyatı</span>
      <strong class="kpi-num" id="kpi-required-price">€989/t</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="kpi-item">
      <span class="kpi-name">Gerekli Fiyat Revizyonu</span>
      <strong class="kpi-num" id="kpi-required-revision">+%16,3</strong>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="action-box">
    <div class="action-notice">
      <strong>Bu hesap hızlı finansal ön analizdir.</strong>
      <p>
        Ücretsiz tahsisat, doğrulama, mahsup, ürün bazlı mevzuat ve müşteri kırılımı detaylı analizde ayrıca uygulanır.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="action-buttons">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://degerlet.com" rel="noopener" target="_blank">
        Şirket analizi oluştur
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .financial-result-container {
    background: #0B0E0E;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .result-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .result-title {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 4px 0 0;
  }
  .kpi-hero-box {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .kpi-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .kpi-hero-value {
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4.2vw, 38px);
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .kpi-sub {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .kpi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .kpi-item {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .kpi-name {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
  .kpi-num {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 650;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .kpi-num.warning-num {
    color: var(--state-warning);
  }
  .kpi-num.danger-num {
    color: var(--state-danger);
  }

  .action-box {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
    padding-top: 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .action-notice strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .action-notice p {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .action-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .action-buttons .btn {
    width: 100%;
  }

  @media (max-width: 580px) {
    .kpi-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
